@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api/v1

### Search instruments - partial ticker match (200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/instruments?query=BB

### Search instruments - partial name match (200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/instruments?query=patagonia

### Search instruments - no matches (200, empty array)
GET {{baseUrl}}/instruments?query=not-a-real-instrument

### Search instruments - missing query (400)
GET {{baseUrl}}/instruments

### Search instruments - blank query (400)
GET {{baseUrl}}/instruments?query=%20%20
